  SYS((GlowUp System))

  U -- scan photo, profile, allergens --> SYS
  SYS -- result, AR preview, scan history --> U
  AD -- catalogue edits, approvals, imports --> SYS
  SYS -- dashboards, pending queues, review data --> AD
  SYS -- recognition / draft requests --> AI
  AI -- candidate names, drafted text --> SYS
  SYS -- verification query --> FDA
  FDA -- legality status --> SYS
  SYS -- catalogue lookup --> OBF
  OBF -- product/ingredient data --> SYS
  CRON -- daily trigger --> SYS
